// The part of a frame that takes in what happened: every waiting event, given to the session in turn.

// One event as gfx_event wrote it (kind in ev[0], fields in ev[1] to ev[4]) given to the session (call_graph_step). A pointer move always asks for a paint, since the tooltip follows it. Answers 1 when the picture is to be painted again.
call_graph_take(string[][] strings_graph, int[][] table_graph, string[][] strings_session, int[][][] bundle, int[] list_event) {
  int number_paint = call_graph_step(strings_graph, table_graph, strings_session, bundle, list_event[0], list_event[1], list_event[2], list_event[3], list_event[4]);
  int number_dirty = fixed_point_maximum(number_paint, list_event[0] == (import graph_view_event_move));
} return int number_dirty;
